        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/b38774/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-01-18T21:12:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We've previously enjoyed a State of GTG post usually the first Tuesday of every month. It gave us a window into where the production cycle was as well as a centralized area to ask follow up questions. Sometimes exactly when it came varied but generally it was on schedule. November's post ended with Paul saying 'I'll see you next month!' but no December update came, and none in January so far either. I hope everything is okay with you GTG folks. Are State of GTG updates a thing of the past?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:52:22.331Z",
